     },
     "html": "<p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; color: #000000;\">Hi {{ contact.firstname }},</span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>We hope we've shared enough valuable information with you to help you get started with your new private label business or take your existing business to the next level..</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Private labeling with <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span> is easy and we've developed our <a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/en/pl-demo-get-started\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\" rel=\"noopener\">wholesale private label supplement program</a> and products with your business and end consumers in mind.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>We have over 250 formulas to support every bodily system and a range of innovative supplement delivery methods so you can have the best product mix available to make an impact in this $4 billion industry.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
