     "html": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>We know that you want to provide top-quality nutritional supplements to your clients and want it to be <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">profitable</span> as well. At <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span>, it\u2019s our mission to help you grow, which means helping you take control of your success.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">When You Partner With <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span> You'll get:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>One-on-one guidance</li>\n<li>Wholesale pricing</li>\n<li>Low minimum orders so that you can test the waters without breaking the bank</li>\n<li>Speedy order turnaround times</li>\n<li>Free shipping</li>\n<li>No set-up fees or hidden charges</li>\n<li>Drag-and-drop Collateral marketing material that you can place your logos on to promote and sell your products</li>\n<li>Top-quality supplements formulated by doctors</li>\n<li>FDA regulatory support</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>If you have questions, <a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\" rel=\"noopener\">feel free to contact us</a> here.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>If you're ready to talk to a branding expert, click the button below.</p>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
